        "      ******************************************************************",
        "      * Program     : CBACT03C.CBL                                      ",
        "      * Application : CardDemo                                          ",
        "      * Type        : BATCH COBOL Program                                ",
        "      * Function    : Read and print account cross reference data file.     ",
        "      ******************************************************************",
